{"title":"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 37","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Segments <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/f/7ffcdfbb239f4fc6927d010456a569ad5d1ef307.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"71\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77c45800bbfb95f7528ab4d16e150dc456f5e87a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BE=6$\" width=\"62\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/9/7195301fa0d36315d8f698271acf471b1d1f13b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CF=24$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"71\" height=\"13\" /> are drawn from the vertices of triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />, each perpendicular to a straight line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/3/7631e00d1deb6ad3d55301906009f15d342e412a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$RS$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />, not intersecting the triangle.  Points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> are the intersection points of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/3/7631e00d1deb6ad3d55301906009f15d342e412a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$RS$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> with the perpendiculars.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is the length of the perpendicular segment <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/7/0a7a248cfd02095e2a009f811d5732a9bea9d595.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$GH$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" /> drawn to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/3/7631e00d1deb6ad3d55301906009f15d342e412a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$RS$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> from the intersection point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> of the medians of the triangle, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/e/46e357479a18293f6e9e84f3369898e955e53b45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{40}{3}\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 16\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{56}{3}\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{80}{3}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{undetermined}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"487\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/6/386255c1da145bc497cf598169ccbaa210e8d0cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>WLOG let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/3/7631e00d1deb6ad3d55301906009f15d342e412a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$RS$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> be the x-axis, or at least horizontal. The three lengths represent the y-coordinates of points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/8/a9874ea56cf8fec1bd246793224fbcfaad17ab3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A,B,C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />. As <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is by definition the average of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/8/a9874ea56cf8fec1bd246793224fbcfaad17ab3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A,B,C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />, it's coordinates are the average of the coordinates of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/a/74ae5f3d2d5c9a0767f5fae081c4f77ee78f2d51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A,B,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"40\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. Hence, the y-coordinate of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, which is also the distance from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/3/7631e00d1deb6ad3d55301906009f15d342e412a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$RS$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />, is the average of the y-coordinates of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/a/74ae5f3d2d5c9a0767f5fae081c4f77ee78f2d51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A,B,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"40\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/d/2eda56fd11bbaf460dd81c4c300a300deea1a8e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{10+6+24}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"92\" height=\"37\" />, hence the result.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME\" title=\"1967 AHSME\">1967 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1967 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1967\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 36\">Problem 36</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 38\">Problem 38</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 31\">31</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"